  m_text: "1. REANIMATE: Consume <color=#11E091>SOUL CHARGE</color> to turn corpses
    into <color=#11E091>MINIONS,</color> <color=#00FFF0>Soul-touched</color> targets
    dont consume <color=#11E091>SOUL CHARGE</color>. \n\n2. REAP: Send out a projectile
    that applies a special <color=#00FFF0>Soul-touch</color> that weakens enemies
    by 10%\n\n3. AWAKEN: Consume <color=#11E091>SOUL CHARGE</color> to summon a <color=#11E091>WARDEN\n\nSOUL
    CHARGE: Gained by applying <color=#00FFF0>Soul-touch</color> to targets."
