      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Gun: Bullets are charged by dealing melee damage.\n\n<color=#00FFF0>Soul-Touched</color>:
    A debuff applied by damage dealt with your Gun or Heavy melee attacks. Mainly
    used for using corpse abilities.\n\nSeverance Damage: Dealing enough severance
    damage cuts off a Soul-Touched Chunk of flesh from targets. Your killing blow
    deals extra severance damage \u2014 if ithey are severed, the target is split
    in half.\n\nHeavy Targets: Cannot be impaled unless they are staggered."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 920e3f49ab9e39b499e69152f5a448bc, type: 2}
